        "text": "Someone asked Becky Hammon if she sees similarities between the Fever's top No. 1 picks and what the Aces had with Kelsey Plum, Jackie Young and A'ja Wilson.\n\nHer response:\n\"No\" 😂\n\nThen A'ja said she loved KM but she was No. 1 and KM was No. 2 🤣",
